title: Police
subtitle: The Interior: training, the pursuit of political violence, the protection of rallies and strikes.
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: govt_affairs
card-image: img/polish/polish_gov_interior.jpg
view-if: {! return !!Q.S && !!Q.polish_security_rules && PolishProjects.cardAvailable(Q, 'internal_security') !}
on-arrival: {!
// Card government.internal_security (technical reference 16.3, 17.12.2; card catalogue 8.12). Opening and closing the card are
// free; a confirmed option costs this month's action. The police stay an organ of the state. Z — 0.99 (the sketch and
// the user's decisions of 7 XI 2026): three permanent options; one gain and one cost each.
PolishProjects.cardView(Q, 'internal_security');
// Z — 0.66 (decision 2A): the ministry of this card, on its page and as a badge in the hand.
Q.pl_gc_ministry = PolishProjects.ministryLine(Q, 'polish_gov_interior');
!}

= Police

*[+ pl_gc_ministry +]*

The state police answer to the minister of the interior, but many commanders still remember the old order. The command of the police stands at [+ pl_gc_police_command +] and its lawfulness at [+ pl_gc_police_lawful +] of 100.

[+ pl_gc_budget +]

[+ pl_gc_projects +]

- @training
- @prosecute
- @protect
- @easy_discard
- @cancel_advisor_action

@training
title: Train the police
subtitle: Costs 1 budget unit. The command and the lawfulness of the police rise (+5); the training can be repeated.
choose-if: {! return PolishProjects.optionStatus(Q, 'internal_security', 'training').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_internal_security_training_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishProjects.chooseOption(Q, 'internal_security', 'training');
!}
go-to: result

@prosecute
title: Pursue the perpetrators of political violence
subtitle: Costs 1 budget unit. Political violence falls (−5), but the National Democrats and the communists resent the pursuit of their people (−3).
choose-if: {! return PolishProjects.optionStatus(Q, 'internal_security', 'prosecute').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_internal_security_prosecute_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishProjects.chooseOption(Q, 'internal_security', 'prosecute');
!}
go-to: result

@protect
title: Protect rallies and strikes
subtitle: No cost to the budget. For half a year the police guard lawful rallies and strikes, even if PPS loses the ministry, so there are fewer clashes; business presses harder on the cabinet (+3).
choose-if: {! return PolishProjects.optionStatus(Q, 'internal_security', 'protect').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_internal_security_protect_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishProjects.chooseOption(Q, 'internal_security', 'protect');
!}
go-to: result

@result
new-page: true

= Police

